{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bone_bundle","model_identifier":"bone_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## bone_bundle\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -9.0..9.0, y -3.1..1.1, z -7.2..-1.4 (size 18.0 x 4.2 x 5.8 u = 51 x 12 x 16 cm).\nBone bundle: three long leg bones (~50 cm) with knobbly ends, tied together with two cords, carried across the arms. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.1.\n"},"description":"## bone_bundle\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -9.0..9.0, y -3.1..1.1, z -7.2..-1.4 (size 18.0 x 4.2 x 5.8 u = 51 x 12 x 16 cm).\nBone bundle: three long leg bones (~50 cm) with knobbly ends, tied together with two cords, carried across the arms. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.1.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"bone_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,-2.75,-3.25],"to":[8.0,-1.25,-1.75],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30,6,46.0,7.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,13,29.5,14.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[46,6,62.0,7.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[30,13,31.5,14.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,9,16.0,10.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[16,9,32.0,10.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e69491a0-ef88-5